sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as Domain Event
    participant N as NotificationService
    participant R as RecipientResolver
    participant S as NotificationStore
    participant Mail as EmailSender
    actor U as Penerima berwenang
    E->>N: publish(eventType, subjectId, actorId)
    N->>R: resolveRecipients(eventType, subjectId)
    R-->>N: Penerima sesuai role dan scope bengkel
    loop Setiap penerima yang berhak
        N->>S: Simpan notifikasi aplikasi
        S-->>N: notificationId
        N-->>U: Pembaruan status dalam aplikasi
        opt Email tersedia
            N->>Mail: send(recipient, event)
            Mail-->>N: Status pengiriman
        end
    end
